    <Counter>\XLANG/s Orchestrations(*)\Idle orchestrations</Counter>
    <Counter>\XLANG/s Orchestrations(*)\Megabytes allocated private memory</Counter>
    <Counter>\XLANG/s Orchestrations(*)\Megabytes allocated virtual memory</Counter>
    <Counter>\XLANG/s Orchestrations(*)\MessageBox databases connection failures</Counter>
